/// known-gap: interp has no concurrency builtins (VM only, spec 2026-10-08)
/// With a context, :swarm calls action(item, context); without one, action(item).
act add(x, ctx)
    return x + ctx{"step"}
xx
act twice(x)
    return x * 2
xx
say(:swarm([1, 2, 3], add, 2, {"step": 10}))
say(:swarm([1, 2, 3], twice, 8))
